WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
To find a polygon's angle sum, split it into triangles.

2
00:00:04.828 --> 00:00:08.403
A square's four angles add to three hundred and sixty.

3
00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:13.106
Split it from A: two triangles, two times one eighty.

4
00:00:15.751 --> 00:00:19.651
Five sides make three triangles: five hundred and forty.

5
00:00:22.629 --> 00:00:26.829
Six sides, four triangles. Always two fewer than the sides.
